{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Control</strong> the <strong>Elf Archer</strong> to move <strong>up/down</strong>, swiftly <strong>attacking</strong> or <strong>dodging</strong> the raptors' ambush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raptors will attack from <strong>various directions</strong>\u2014stay alert to <strong>defend your homeland</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power-up items</strong> randomly spawn on the battlefield. Collect them to boost:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Archer Level</strong> (\u2191Range)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Attack Power</strong> (\u2191Damage)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Archer Count</strong> (\u2191Targets)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Attack Speed</strong> (\u2191Fire Rate)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face <strong>endless waves of raptors</strong> and experience the <strong>cathartic joy of mowing them down</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple Controls</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<strong>W</strong>&quot;/&quot;<strong>S</strong>&quot;: Move Elf Archer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<strong>ESC</strong>&quot;: Pause Game</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702640?t=1745897271","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702640?t=1745897271","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702640/a9f40d943c75630a5283a341f5b9bb222f9bd3f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745897271","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702640/a9f40d943c75630a5283a341f5b9bb222f9bd3f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745897271","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Control</strong> the <strong>Elf Archer</strong> to move <strong>up/down</strong>, swiftly <strong>attacking</strong> or <strong>dodging</strong> the raptors' ambush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raptors will attack from <strong>various directions</strong>\u2014stay alert to <strong>defend your homeland</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power-up items</strong> randomly spawn on the battlefield. Collect them to boost:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Archer Level</strong> (\u2191Range)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Attack Power</strong> (\u2191Damage)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Archer Count</strong> (\u2191Targets)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Attack Speed</strong> (\u2191Fire Rate)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face <strong>endless waves of raptors</strong> and experience the <strong>cathartic joy of mowing them down</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple Controls</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<strong>W</strong>&quot;/&quot;<strong>S</strong>&quot;: Move Elf Archer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<strong>ESC</strong>&quot;: Pause Game</p></li></ul>","developers":["AA Mini Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702640/dfe97ea7abb57f9941c65c1b64c9b863cbde3687/header.jpg?t=1745897271","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131144,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131144/movie480.mp4?t=1745897269","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131144/movie_max.mp4?t=1745897269"},"name":"Shadowstrike","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131144/82457f52